  Spanish translation of values/strings_finance_budget.xml.
  Finance: the Budget tab, where the month's credit card spending (read through Plaid) is set
  against the household's limits, and its settings page. fin_budget_* throughout.
  Plaid is a company's name and stays as it is. %-placeholders that carry money arrive already
  formatted ("$4,500"), and names of people, cards and merchants are data, shown as written.
-->
